<Title>The Elections and Elected Bodies (Wales) Act 2024 (Commencement No. 1) Order 2024</Title>
<MadeDate>
<Text>Made</Text>
<DateText>13 December 2024</DateText>
</MadeDate>
<SecondaryPreamble>
<EnactingText>
<Para>
<Text>The Welsh Ministers make the following Order in exercise of the power conferred on them by section 72(4) and (6) of the Elections and Elected Bodies (Wales) Act 2024<FootnoteRef Ref="f00001"/>.</Text>
</Para>
</EnactingText>
</SecondaryPreamble>
</SecondaryPrelims>
<Body DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/body/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/body" NumberOfProvisions="3">
<P1group>
<Title>Title and interpretation</Title>
<P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/1/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/1" id="article-1">
<Pnumber>1</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/1/1/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/1/1" id="article-1-1">
<Pnumber>1</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>The title of this Order is the Elections and Elected Bodies (Wales) Act 2024 (Commencement No. 1) Order 2024.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/1/2/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/1/2" id="article-1-2">
<Pnumber>2</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>In this Order, “<Term id="term-the-act">the Act</Term>” means the Elections and Elected Bodies (Wales) Act 2024.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
</P1para>
</P1>
</P1group>
<P1group>
<Title>Provisions coming into force on 1 January 2025</Title>
<P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2" id="article-2">
<Pnumber>2</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<Text>The following provisions of the Act come into force on 1 January 2025—</Text>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/a/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/a" id="article-2-a">
<Pnumber>a</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 1 (Electoral Management Board of Democracy and Boundary Commission Cymru);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/b/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/b" id="article-2-b">
<Pnumber>b</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 2 and Part 1 of Schedule 1 (minor and consequential amendments);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/c/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/c" id="article-2-c">
<Pnumber>c</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 26 (Welsh elections information platform);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/d/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/d" id="article-2-d">
<Pnumber>d</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 28 (financial assistance schemes to promote diversity in persons seeking elected office);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/e/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/e" id="article-2-e">
<Pnumber>e</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 29 (excluded persons);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/f/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/f" id="article-2-f">
<Pnumber>f</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 31 (interpretation of Chapter 4 of Part 1);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/g/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/g" id="article-2-g">
<Pnumber>g</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 32 (notional expenditure: candidates in local government elections);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/h/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/h" id="article-2-h">
<Pnumber>h</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 33 (notional and third party expenditure: Senedd Cymru elections);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/i/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/i" id="article-2-i">
<Pnumber>i</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 34 (codes of practice on expenses);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/j/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/j" id="article-2-j">
<Pnumber>j</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 35 (authorised persons not required to pay through election agent);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/k/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/k" id="article-2-k">
<Pnumber>k</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 36 (restriction on which third parties may incur controlled expenditure);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/l/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/l" id="article-2-l">
<Pnumber>l</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 37 (third parties capable of giving notification);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/m/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/m" id="article-2-m">
<Pnumber>m</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 38 (code of practice on controls relating to third parties);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/n/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/n" id="article-2-n">
<Pnumber>n</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 39 and Part 3 of Schedule 1 (minor and consequential amendments);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/o/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/o" id="article-2-o">
<Pnumber>o</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 67 (Democracy and Boundary Commission Cymru: governance and audit committee);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/p/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/2/p" id="article-2-p">
<Pnumber>p</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 68 (Democracy and Boundary Commission Cymru: power to charge).</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
</P1para>
</P1>
</P1group>
<P1group>
<Title>Provisions coming into force on 1 April 2025</Title>
<P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3" id="article-3">
<Pnumber>3</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<Text>The following provisions of the Act come into force on 1 April 2025—</Text>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/a/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/a" id="article-3-a">
<Pnumber>a</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 27 (services to promote diversity in persons seeking elected office);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/b/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/b" id="article-3-b">
<Pnumber>b</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 56 (abolition of Independent Remuneration Panel for Wales);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/c/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/c" id="article-3-c">
<Pnumber>c</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 57 (Democracy and Boundary Commission Cymru functions relating to remuneration);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/d/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/d" id="article-3-d">
<Pnumber>d</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 58 (transfer of property, rights and liabilities);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/e/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/e" id="article-3-e">
<Pnumber>e</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 59 and Part 4 of Schedule 1 (minor and consequential amendments);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/f/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/article/3/f" id="article-3-f">
<Pnumber>f</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>section 60 (savings).</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
</P1para>
</P1>
</P1group>
