<ExplanatoryNotes DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/wsi/2024/1337/note/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/wsi/2024/1337/note">
<Title>EXPLANATORY NOTE</Title>
<Comment>
<Para>
<Text>(This note is not part of the Order)</Text>
</Para>
</Comment>
<P>
<Text Hanging="indented">This Order, made by the Welsh Ministers, brings into force certain provisions of the Elections and Elected Bodies (Wales) Act 2024.</Text>
</P>
<P>
<Text Hanging="indented">Article 2 of this Order brings into force on 1 January 2025, the provisions specified in that article.</Text>
</P>
<P>
<Text Hanging="indented">Article 3 of this Order brings into force on 1 April 2025, the provisions specified in that article.</Text>
</P>
</ExplanatoryNotes>
